Short:        ownCloud/Nextcloud drive and sync
Author:       Ronny Krueger
Uploader:     amitools@planet-rk.de (Ronny Krueger)
Type:         comm/net
Version:      @VERSION@
Architecture: m68k-amigaos >= 3.0.0
Requires:     util/libs/AmiSSL-v5-OS3.lha
Distribution: Aminet

AmiOwnCloud connects AmigaOS 3.x to an ordinary ownCloud or Nextcloud
server over WebDAV (HTTPS):

  OWNCLOUD:              DOS handler - the server as volume OWNCLOUD:
  AmiOwnCloudPrefs       settings for OWNCLOUD:
  AmiOwnCloudSync        commodity: keeps folder pairs in sync
  AmiOwnCloudSyncPrefs   settings and folder pairs for AmiOwnCloudSync
  amiowncloud-sync       shell command: one-shot folder sync
  amiowncloud-synctest   shell command: test suite against a real server

No MUI needed (GadTools/Commodities). Works with app passwords.

Installation
------------
Unpack the archive and double-click "Install-AmiOwnCloud" (Commodore
Installer, part of OS 3.2 in SYS:System). Without the Installer, use the
shell script instead:  CD AmiOwnCloud  and  Execute Install-AmiOwnCloud.shell
Existing settings and an existing DOSDriver are never overwritten.

Requirements
------------
- AmigaOS 3.x, 68020 or better (since 0.2), no FPU needed
- a TCP/IP stack with bsdsocket.library (Roadshow, AmiTCP, Miami, ...)
- AmiSSL 5 (Aminet util/libs/AmiSSL-v5-OS3.lha)
- optional: codesets.library 6 or newer for umlauts in other charsets
  than ISO-8859-1 (util/libs/codesets-6.22.lha)
- optional: xvs.library for the virus check of downloads
  (util/virus/xvslibrary.lha)
- an account on an ownCloud or Nextcloud server

Documentation and user interface are in German.
Die Dokumentation (Docs/AmiOwnCloud.guide) und die Programme sind deutsch.

